  Shake preview (elide)
  Estimated conversation: 118,000 → 71,000 tokens. Frees ~47,000 (40%).
  24 tool outputs and 8 text blocks. Recent ~4k tokens stay protected; removed text
  is recoverable.

  The next request may cost more from lost cache reuse. Later requests carry less
  context; recovery reads add tokens back.

  Estimates exclude base instructions and tool schemas. Exact subscription or API
  savings depend on future requests.

